    {
      "id": "node_24",
      "type": "Text",
      "class_name": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "“US strikes over the weekend on Kharg Island raised supply concerns, as most of Iran’s oil exports pass through it,” ING commodity strategists said on March 16.",
      "resource_id": "",
      "content_desc": "",
      "bounds": [
        64,
        1271,
        1376,
        1719
      ],
      "center": [
        720,
        1495
      ],
      "area": 587776,
      "visible": true,
      "clickable": false,
      "scrollable": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "checked": false,
      "selected": false,
      "parent_id": "node_22",
      "children_ids": [],
      "depth": 17,
      "in_scroll_container": true,
      "package_name": "com.buuuk.st"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_25",
      "type": "Text",
      "class_name": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "While the strikes appear to have targeted military, rather than energy, infrastructure, they still pose supply risks since Iranian oil is about the only oil moving through the Strait of Hormuz for now, ING added.",
      "resource_id": "",
      "content_desc": "",
      "bounds": [
        64,
        1719,
        1376,
        2263
      ],
      "center": [
        720,
        1991
      ],
      "area": 713728,
      "visible": true,
      "clickable": false,
      "scrollable": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "checked": false,
      "selected": false,
      "parent_id": "node_22",
      "children_ids": [],
      "depth": 17,
      "in_scroll_container": true,
      "package_name": "com.buuuk.st"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_26",
      "type": "Text",
      "class_name": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "Over the weekend, Mr Trump threatened further strikes on Iran’s Kharg Island, which handles about 90 per cent of its exports, after hitting military targets there, to spur a defiant response of more retaliation from Tehran.",
      "resource_id": "",
      "content_desc": "",
      "bounds": [
        64,
        2263,
        1376,
        2560
      ],
      "center": [
